{"type":"message","id":"e6c8d5c1","parentId":"888c2da1","timestamp":"2026-07-02T08:06:56.114Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. Let me summarize what happened:\n\n1. **ETH平仓失败循环**: monitor tried to close ETH position 5 times but all failed:\n   - First attempt: ReduceOnly rejected (code -2022) - position may have already been closed\n   - Then tried to open a SHORT as fallback but notional too small (code -4164, need ≥20 USDT)\n   - Each retry: open LONG (to offset) then open SHORT (to close), all failing with -4164\n   - After 5 retries, gave up\n\n2. **Current PnL**: -13.34 USDT (-13.3%) today\n   - DOT LONG: +2.67U (+1.34%)\n   - BNB SHORT: -0.03U (-0.01%)\n   - Plus another position (3 API positions but 2 local cache, and ETH was problematic)\n\n3. The balance drop from 5030 to 4995 (~35 USDT) could be from:\n   - The ETH position that couldn't be closed properly\n   - Today's overall PnL of -13.34 doesn't fully explain 35 drop but combined with ETH losses it could\n\nThe key issue is the ETH position close failure loop. The monitor claimed success for 3 \"close\" actions in the verify_trades output, but the actual log shows they all failed with -4164 error (notional too small). This is a bug in how the monitor logs success/failure.\n\nLet me present this clearly to the husband without listing commands.\n\nActually wait - the verify_trades script showed \"✅ 平仓 ETH @1606.41 ✅\" three times, but the real log shows all failed. The verify_trades script is incorrectly parsing the log - it matched the \"✅ 平仓\" pattern but didn't check if it was actually successful or not.\n\nThe problem is clear:\n1. ETH position close completely failed (5 retries, all rejected by Binance)\n2. The log line says \"✅ 平仓\" but ends with \"❌ 平仓失败\" - the verify script only matched the ✅ prefix\n3. Today's PnL is -13.34 USDT but with ETH losses it could be more\n\nNow let me tell the husband what's going on in plain language. Don't list commands.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到问题了，老公。\n\n**ETH平仓全部失败了。** monitor 从 15:59 开始尝试平 ETH 仓位，重试了 5 次全部被币安拒单：\n- 第一次：ReduceOnly 被拒（-2022），仓位可能已经不存在了\n- 后面 4 次：降级开空平仓，但名义价值不足 20 USDT 被拒（-4164）\n- 最终放弃，日志里写了 `❌ 平仓失败`\n\n**但 verify_trades 脚本误判了**——它只看 `✅ 平仓` 前缀就认为是成功，没看到后面跟着 `❌ 平仓失败`，这是个解析 bug。\n\n当前状态：3 个持仓，今日 PnL -13.34 USDT。ETH 这个仓位卡住了，想平平不掉、数量又太小不够 20U 名义价值。\n\n要不要我先把 verify_trades 那个解析 bug 修了，然后看看 ETH 仓位现在实际什么状态？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":2296,"output":1210,"cacheRead":24704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28210,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1782979601935}}
